Change an exit assignment or a port forward

Usage:
  olr gateway set [command]

Available Commands:
  client           Give one client its own way out
  default          Set the exit everything uses unless something more specific says otherwise
  destination      Route a destination through an exit (overrides device and network choices)
  forward          Change an existing port forward
  ipv6-forwarding  Let IPv6 pass through this router
  traffic-counting Count how much each client uses
  via              Send one network's traffic through an exit

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for set

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr gateway set [command] --help" for more information about a command.
